@startuml
!theme plain
title Head of Department Assigns a Lecturer
actor "Head of Department" as HOD
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Assignment API" as API
participant "Authorization Service" as Auth
database PostgreSQL as DB

HOD -> UI: assign lecturer to module offering
UI -> API: lecturer, offering, workload, effective dates
API -> Auth: require academic.assign_lecturer
Auth -> DB: verify independent HOD role + organisational scope
DB --> Auth: authorised descendant scope
Auth --> API: allowed
API -> DB: lock active matching assignment(s)
API -> DB: end superseded assignment(s), preserving history
API -> DB: insert new lecturer assignment
API -> DB: append audit/outbox event
API --> UI: current assignment and history reference
@enduml
